{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:21:203","content":{"id":203,"title":"19 抗原层递","content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"辅助 T 洗吧只会碰那些抱在细胞表面 MHC-II 类分子中的抗原，这样就不会碰到血液或淋巴液中的游离抗原。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"过程："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"numbered-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"树突细胞在战场把细菌的抗原包裹在 MHC-II 类分子中"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"树突细胞开始迁移，经淋巴系统来到淋巴结，找到辅助 T 细胞"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"辅助 T 细胞如果能识别抗原，就会和抗原结合"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"为防止辅助 T 细胞意外激活，还需要另一种信号"}],"disableDrag":false}]}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_6a7d6fe4-44fe-4094-8995-5cc06a8abd4f.png","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_6a7d6fe4-44fe-4094-8995-5cc06a8abd4f.png"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"到达淋巴结后，树突细胞有一周左右时间需找到合适的 T 细胞，之后内部凋亡程序启动，随机自杀。定时删除可确保不会按照过时的信息行动。"}],"disableDrag":false}],"breadcrumb":[{"label":"《战斗细胞》","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:170","type":"doc","id":170}},{"label":"第二部分，惨重损伤"},{"label":"19 抗原层递","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:203","type":"doc","id":203}}],"prevPage":{"title":"18 胸腺 -- 杀手大师","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:175","type":"doc","id":175}},"nextPage":{"title":"20 唤醒适应性免疫系统：T细胞","target":{"key":"doc:project:21:204","type":"doc","id":204}},"createTime":1741563743837,"updateTime":1756124017524,"projectId":21},"meta":{"type":"doc","publishTime":1756124017524}}